<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/13th-century">13th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1227</h1><p class="ref-lede">1227 in world history: 9 events, 1 birth, 11 deaths and 2 states that came to an end. 686 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
